:"","language":"gujarati"},{"id":"universe-u296-mus9q4bq","name":"Riya","phone":"","trip":"","stage":"qualified","value":0,"source":"universe","created":1791024468326,"updated":1791024468326,"next":1791031668330,"touches":1,"notes":"","language":"english"},{"id":"universe-u297-mus9q4bz","name":"Anjali","phone":"","trip":"","stage":"objection","value":0,"source":"universe","created":1791024468335,"updated":1791024468376,"next":1791110868376,"touches":7,"notes":"","language":"english"},{"id":"universe-u298-mus9q4da","name":"Neha","phone":"","trip":"","stage":"objection","value":0,"source":"universe","created":1791024468382,"updated":1791024468482,"next":1791110868498,"touches":9,"notes":"","language":"hinglish","lastObjection":"price"},{"id":"universe-u299-mus9q4go","name":"Pooja","phone":"","trip":"Manali","stage":"quoted","value":0,"source":"universe","created":1791024468504,"updated":1791024468536,"next":1791110868549,"touches":5,"notes":"","language":"hinglish"}],"threads":{"universe-u0-mus9pzob":{"id":"universe-u0-mus9pzob","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 1 of us planning goa for a weekend escape, is it available?","t":1791024462299},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Goa departs 12 Dec, a Saturday (weekend), and returns 15 Dec, Tuesday. That is 2 days of leave for office-goers. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person, 7 seats left. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold one?","t":1791024462340,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024462341},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹17,400. Advance now and balance 7 days before departure makes it easier. To hold a seat, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024462374,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024462375},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024462392,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024462393},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. To hold a seat, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024462393,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024462395},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. To hold a seat, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024462395,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462299,"said":{"group":1,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462317,"text":"hi, 1 of us planning goa for a weekend escape, is it available?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462346,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462375,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462393,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462395,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u1-mus9pzr0":{"id":"universe-u1-mus9pzr0","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 2 log, long vacation ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024462396},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Manali plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Solang; D3 Atal Tunnel; D4 Old Manali cafes; D5 breakfast, last stop, return. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person, 17 seats left. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹25,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024462406,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 2","t":1791024462407},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Badhiya! Manali ke 2 seats hold kar rahe hain. Advance ₹4,000 per person UPI tc@upi par bhejkar screenshot yahan bhejo, aur sabke poore naam (ID ke jaisa). Team Travelers Clan ka member abhi confirm karega.","t":1791024462409,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024462410},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462411,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024462412},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462413,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","t":1791024462414},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462415,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462396,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false,"booked":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462397,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 2 log, long vacation ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462407,"text":"hold karo 2","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462411,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462413,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462414,"text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u2-mus9pzrk":{"id":"universe-u2-mus9pzrk","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 2 लोगों के लिए, honeymoon, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024462416},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Congratulations! Haan, private double room couple ke liye mil jaata hai: supplement lagbhag ₹2,200 per person poore trip ka (exact figure hotel confirmation ke saath), baaki sab same, aur honeymoon ke liye room decor aur ek dinner table alag se, captain sambhal lega. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person, 7 seats left. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹29,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024462418,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 2","t":1791024462419},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Badhiya! Goa ke 2 seats hold kar rahe hain. Advance ₹4,500 per person UPI tc@upi par bhejkar screenshot yahan bhejo, aur sabke poore naam (ID ke jaisa). Team Travelers Clan ka member abhi confirm karega.","t":1791024462421,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024462421},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462422,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024462423},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462423,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462416,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false,"booked":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462417,"text":"गोवा 2 लोगों के लिए, honeymoon, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462419,"text":"hold karo 2","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462422,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462423,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u3-mus9pzrt":{"id":"universe-u3-mus9pzrt","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462425},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462426,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462425,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462426,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u4-mus9pzrv":{"id":"universe-u4-mus9pzrv","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462427},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462427,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462427,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462427,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u5-mus9pzrw":{"id":"universe-u5-mus9pzrw","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","t":1791024462428},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024462434,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462428,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462429,"text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u6-mus9pzs4":{"id":"universe-u6-mus9pzs4","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 17 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024462436},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person, 5 seats left. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 17 logon ka total ₹2,46,500. Abhi 5 hi seats hain; baaki ke liye waiting list. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024462441,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024462442},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. 17 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462450,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024462451},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462461,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024462462},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462463,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024462463},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462464,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024462464},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462465,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024462466},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462466,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462436,"said":{"group":17,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462436,"text":"गोवा 17 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462442,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462451,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462462,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462464,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462465,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462466,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u7-mus9pzsz":{"id":"universe-u7-mus9pzsz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024462467},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462468,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024462469},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462470,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024462470},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Rohan, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462471,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024462472},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024462482,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024462483},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462484,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024462484},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462485,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","t":1791024462486},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462486,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024462487},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Rohan, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024462488,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462467,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462467,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462469,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462471,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462472,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462483,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462485,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462486,"text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462488,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u8-mus9pztm":{"id":"universe-u8-mus9pztm","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462490},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462490,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462490,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462490,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u9-mus9pztn":{"id":"universe-u9-mus9pztn","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462491},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462491,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462491,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462491,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u10-mus9pzto":{"id":"universe-u10-mus9pzto","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462492},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462493,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462492,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462493,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u11-mus9pztq":{"id":"universe-u11-mus9pztq","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","t":1791024462494},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024462498,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462494,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462494,"text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-