ain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462515,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024462516},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462516,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"डिस्काउंट?","t":1791024462517},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Anjali, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024462518,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462500,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462501,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462502,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462504,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462505,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462514,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462515,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462516,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462518,"text":"डिस्काउंट?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u14-mus9pzuf":{"id":"universe-u14-mus9pzuf","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462519},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462519,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462519,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462519,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u15-mus9pzug":{"id":"universe-u15-mus9pzug","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","t":1791024462520},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024462525,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462520,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462521,"text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u16-mus9pzum":{"id":"universe-u16-mus9pzum","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"yeh promise nahi tha, room ganda tha. refund chahiye","t":1791024462526},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024462529,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462526,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462526,"text":"yeh promise nahi tha, room ganda tha. refund chahiye","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u17-mus9pzuq":{"id":"universe-u17-mus9pzuq","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024462530},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462531,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024462532},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462538,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024462539},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Neha, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462540,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024462541},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, I get it. We take ₹4,500 as advance and the rest in two parts, and in a group of 6 or more the organiser travels free. Which trip are you looking at? I will find the cheapest batch that fits.","t":1791024462549,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024462550},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462550,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024462551},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462552,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024462552},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462553,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"any discount for 1?","t":1791024462554},{"role":"clan","text":"In short: Neha, I get it. We take ₹4,500 as advance and the rest in two parts, and in a group of 6 or more the organiser travels free.","t":1791024462572,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462530,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true,"group":1},"intents":[{"t":1791024462531,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462532,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462539,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462541,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462550,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462552,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462553,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462554,"text":"any discount for 1?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u18-mus9pzvx":{"id":"universe-u18-mus9pzvx","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","t":1791024462573},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024462577,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462573,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462573,"text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u19-mus9pzw2":{"id":"universe-u19-mus9pzw2","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024462578},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462579,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024462579},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462580,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024462581},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462581,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024462582},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462583,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024462583},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462584,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024462585},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462585,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024462586},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462586,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462578,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462578,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462580,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462581,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462582,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462584,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462585,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462586,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u20-mus9pzwb":{"id":"universe-u20-mus9pzwb","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 3 of us planning goa for a long vacation, is it available?","t":1791024462587},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person, 5 seats left. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 3 people the total is ₹43,500. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 3 seats?","t":1791024462592,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 3 seats","t":1791024462593},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Great! Holding 3 seats on Goa. Send the ₹4,500 per person advance to UPI tc@upi and the screenshot here, with the full names as on ID. A Travelers Clan team member will confirm it personally in a few minutes.","t":1791024462595,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024462596},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462596,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024462597},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462597,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024462598},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462599,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024462600},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462600,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462587,"said":{"group":3,"price":true,"regroup":false,"booked":true,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462587,"text":"hi, 3 of us planning goa for a long vacation, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462594,"text":"ok hold 3 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462596,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462597,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462599,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462600,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u21-mus9pzwp":{"id":"universe-u21-mus9pzwp","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 5 of us planning manali for a bachelor trip, is it available?","t":1791024462601},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person, 15 seats left. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 5 people the total is ₹62,500. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 5 seats?","t":1791024462607,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024462608},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Manali has 17 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024462614,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024462615},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. To hold 5 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024462615,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024462616},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. To hold 5 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024462617,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024462618},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. To hold 5 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024462618,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","t":1791024462619},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. For seniors: good; we take an emergency contact and a medicine list, and the captain checks on them every day. If it helps, I can set up a 5 minute call with the founder before you decide. ","t":1791024462620,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462601,"said":{"group":5,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462601,"text":"hi, 5 of us planning manali for a bachelor trip, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462608,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462615,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462616,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462618,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462619,"text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u22-mus9pzx9":{"id":"universe-u22-mus9pzx9","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 12 लोगों के लिए, college trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024462621},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person, 2 seats left. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 12 logon ka total ₹1,74,000. Abhi 2 hi seats hain; baaki ke liye waiting list. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024462625,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024462627},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. 12 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462633,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024462635},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462643,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024462644},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462645,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"डिस्काउंट?","t":1791024462646},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Pooja, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. 12 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do.","t":1791024462646,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","t":1791024462647},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Pooja, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462648,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024462649},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462650,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462621,"said":{"group":12,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462621,"text":"गोवा 12 लोगों के लिए, college trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462627,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462635,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462644,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462646,"text":"डिस्काउंट?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462648,"text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462649,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u23-mus9pzy3":{"id":"universe-u23-mus9pzy3","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024462651},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462651,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024462652},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462658,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024462659},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462660,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024462661},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462661,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024462662},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462662,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"i need to ask my wife","t":1791024462663},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Of course, take your time.","t":1791024462678,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024462679},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462680,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462651,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462651,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462653,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462659,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462661,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462662,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462664,"text":"i need to ask my wife","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462680,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u24-mus9pzyx":{"id":"universe-u24-mus9pzyx","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024462681},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462682,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024462683},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462684,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024462685},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462685,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024462686},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024462694,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024462695},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462695,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024462697},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462697,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024462698},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Riya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024462699,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462681,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462681,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462683,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462685,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462687,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462695,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462697,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462698,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u25-mus9pzzg":{"id":"universe-u25-mus9pzzg","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 2 लोगों के लिए, honeymoon, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024462700},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Congratulations! Haan, private double room couple ke liye mil jaata hai: supplement lagbhag ₹1,900 per person poore trip ka (exact figure hotel confirmation ke saath), baaki sab same, aur honeymoon ke liye room decor aur ek dinner table alag se, captain sambhal lega. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person, 15 seats left. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹25,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024462701,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 2","t":1791024462702},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Badhiya! Manali ke 2 seats hold kar rahe hain. Advance ₹4,000 per person UPI tc@upi par bhejkar screenshot yahan bhejo, aur sabke poore naam (ID ke jaisa). Team Travelers Clan ka member abhi confirm karega.","t":1791024462703,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024462704},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462705,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024462706},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462706,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024462708},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462708,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462700,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false,"booked":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462700,"text":"मनाली 2 लोगों के लिए, honeymoon, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462702,"text":"hold karo 2","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462705,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462706,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462708,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u26-mus9pzzp":{"id":"universe-u26-mus9pzzp","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 4 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024462709},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Goa 12 Dec ko Saturday ko nikalta hai (weekend) aur 15 Dec Tuesday ko wapas. Office walon ko 2 din ki chhutti lagegi. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person, 2 seats left. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹58,000. Abhi 2 hi seats hain; baaki ke liye waiting list. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024462710,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 4","t":1791024462711},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Goa mein sirf 2 seats bachi hain, 4 nahi. 2 hold kar di hain; baaki 2 ke liye waiting list ya agla batch. Advance ₹4,500 per person tc@upi par bhejkar screenshot bhejo; team turant confirm karegi.","t":1791024462714,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024462715},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462716,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024462717},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462717,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024462718},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462719,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024462720},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462721,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462709,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462709,"text":"ગોવા 4 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462711,"text":"hold karo 4","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462716,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462717,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462719,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462720,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u27-mus9q002":{"id":"universe-u27-mus9q002","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462722},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462722,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462722,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462722,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u28-mus9q004":{"id":"universe-u28-mus9q004","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","t":1791024462724},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024462728,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462724,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462724,"text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u29-mus9q009":{"id":"universe-u29-mus9q009","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 5 of us planning manali for a pilgrimage, is it available?","t":1791024462729},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person, 13 seats left. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 5 people the total is ₹62,500. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 5 seats?","t":1791024462735,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 5 seats","t":1791024462737},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Great! Holding 5 seats on Manali. Send the ₹4,000 per person advance to UPI tc@upi and the screenshot here, with the full names as on ID. A Travelers Clan team member will confirm it personally in a few minutes.","t":1791024462738,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024462740},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462740,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024462741},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462742,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024462743},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462743,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462729,"said":{"group":5,"price":true,"regroup":false,"booked":true,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462730,"text":"hi, 5 of us planning manali for a pilgrimage, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462737,"text":"ok hold 5 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462740,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462741,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462743,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u30-mus9q00o":{"id":"universe-u30-mus9q00o","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462744},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462745,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462744,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462745,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u31-mus9q00r":{"id":"universe-u31-mus9q00r","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462747},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462747,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462747,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462747,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u32-mus9q00t":{"id":"universe-u32-mus9q00t","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024462749},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462749,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462749,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462749,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u33-mus9q00v":{"id":"universe-u33-mus9q00v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the captain was rude. i want a refund","t":1791024462751},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024462754,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462751,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462751,"text":"this is not what was promised, the captain was rude. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u34-mus9q010":{"id":"universe-u34-mus9q010","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 2 of us planning goa for a honeymoon, is it available?","t":1791024462756},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Congratulations! Yes, a private double room for the two of you is available: the supplement is about ₹2,200 per person for the whole trip (exact figure with the hotel confirmation), everything else stays the same, and the captain arranges the room decor and a dinner table for two. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 2 people the total is ₹29,000. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 2 seats?","t":1791024462757,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 2 seats","t":1791024462758},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462759,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024462760},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462761,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024462762},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462762,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024462763},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Yes, of course. Ask me anything else; reply \"hold\" when you want the seats held.","t":1791024462780,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462756,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462756,"text":"hi, 2 of us planning goa for a honeymoon, is it available?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462758,"text":"ok hold 2 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462761,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462762,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462764,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u35-mus9q01q":{"id":"universe-u35-mus9q01q","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 21 of us planning manali for a family reunion, is it available?","t":1791024462782},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person, 8 seats left. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 21 people the total is ₹2,62,500. Only 8 seats remain on this batch; the rest can go on the waiting list. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 21 seats?","t":1791024462786,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 21 seats","t":1791024462788},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Manali has only 8 seats left, not 21. I have held 8; the other 13 go on the waiting list or the next batch. Send the ₹4,000 per person advance to tc@upi with the screenshot and the team confirms right away.","t":1791024462791,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024462792},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462793,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024462794},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462794,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024462796},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024462796,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024462797},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Yes, of course. Ask me anything else; reply \"hold\" when you want the seats held.","t":1791024462814,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462782,"said":{"group":21,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462782,"text":"hi, 21 of us planning manali for a family reunion, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462788,"text":"ok hold 21 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462792,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462794,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462796,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462798,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u36-mus9q02o":{"id":"universe-u36-mus9q02o","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024462816},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462816,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024462818},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462823,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024462825},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Kavya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462825,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024462826},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, I get it. We take ₹4,500 as advance and the rest in two parts, and in a group of 6 or more the organiser travels free. Which trip are you looking at? I will find the cheapest batch that fits.","t":1791024462834,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024462835},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462836,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024462837},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024462837,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"any discount for 3?","t":1791024462839},{"role":"clan","text":"Once more: Kavya, I get it. We take ₹4,500 as advance and the rest in two parts, and in a group of 6 or more the organiser travels free.","t":1791024462856,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"i need to ask my wife","t":1791024462858},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Of course, take your time.","t":1791024462879,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462816,"said":{"regroup":false,"group":3},"intents":[{"t":1791024462816,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462818,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462825,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462827,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462836,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462837,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462839,"text":"any discount for 3?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462858,"text":"i need to ask my wife","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u37-mus9q04g":{"id":"universe-u37-mus9q04g","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 2 लोगों के लिए, honeymoon, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024462881},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Congratulations! Haan, private double room couple ke liye mil jaata hai: supplement lagbhag ₹1,900 per person poore trip ka (exact figure hotel confirmation ke saath), baaki sab same, aur honeymoon ke liye room decor aur ek dinner table alag se, captain sambhal lega. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹25,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024462881,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 2","t":1791024462883},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462885,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024462887},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462887,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024462889},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462890,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462881,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462881,"text":"मनाली 2 लोगों के लिए, honeymoon, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462884,"text":"hold karo 2","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462887,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462889,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u38-mus9q04s":{"id":"universe-u38-mus9q04s","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024462892},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462892,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024462894},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462894,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024462895},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462896,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024462897},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462898,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024462900},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462901,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024462903},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462903,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"बच्चों के लिए ठीक है?","t":1791024462905},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Zyada traveller 20 se 40 ke hain; relaxed batches mein family aur parents welcome hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024462906,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462892,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462892,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462894,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462896,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462898,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462900,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462903,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462906,"text":"बच्चों के लिए ठीक है?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u39-mus9q058":{"id":"universe-u39-mus9q058","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"મનાલી 3 લોકો માટે, family reunion, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024462908},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 3 logon ka total ₹37,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024462913,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 3","t":1791024462916},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024462917,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024462919},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462919,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024462921},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462921,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","t":1791024462922},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024462923,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"પત્ની ને પૂછવું પડશે","t":1791024462924},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024462925,"auto":false