take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024462986,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462965,"said":{"group":9,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024462965,"text":"hi, 9 of us planning goa for a college trip, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462971,"text":"ok hold 9 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462974,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024462975,"text":"i need to ask my wife","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u43-mus9q07f":{"id":"universe-u43-mus9q07f","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 1 of us planning manali for a family reunion, is it available?","t":1791024462987},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold one?","t":1791024462991,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024462993},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹15,000. Advance now and balance 7 days before departure makes it easier. To hold a seat, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024462998,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 1 seat","t":1791024463000},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Manali 20 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463000,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024463002},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463002,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"any discount for 1?","t":1791024463004},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹15,000. Advance now and balance 7 days before departure makes it easier. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463014,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024463016},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. To hold a seat, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024463016,"auto":false}],"created":1791024462987,"said":{"group":1,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024462988,"text":"hi, 1 of us planning manali for a family reunion, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024462993,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463000,"text":"ok hold 1 seat","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463002,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463004,"text":"any discount for 1?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463016,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u44-mus9q089":{"id":"universe-u44-mus9q089","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024463017},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463018,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024463020},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463020,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024463022},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463023,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024463024},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024463031,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024463033},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463033,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024463035},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463035,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બાળકો માટે ઠીક છે?","t":1791024463037},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Zyada traveller 20 se 40 ke hain; relaxed batches mein family aur parents welcome hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463038,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","t":1791024463039},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463040,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463017,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024463018,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463020,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463022,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463024,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463033,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463035,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463037,"text":"બાળકો માટે ઠીક છે?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463040,"text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u45-mus9q08y":{"id":"universe-u45-mus9q08y","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the food was cold every day. i want a refund","t":1791024463042},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024463045,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463042,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463042,"text":"this is not what was promised, the food was cold every day. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u46-mus9q093":{"id":"universe-u46-mus9q093","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024463047},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463048,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024463049},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463055,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024463056},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Rohan, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463057,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024463058},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463059,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024463061},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463061,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463047,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463047,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463049,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463057,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463059,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463061,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u47-mus9q09i":{"id":"universe-u47-mus9q09i","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 3 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024463062},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 3 logon ka total ₹37,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463066,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 3","t":1791024463068},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463068,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024463070},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463070,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024463072},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463072,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024463074},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463074,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024463076},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463076,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463062,"said":{"group":3,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024463063,"text":"मनाली 3 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463068,"text":"hold karo 3","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463070,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463072,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463074,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463076,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u48-mus9q09x":{"id":"universe-u48-mus9q09x","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024463079},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463079,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024463081},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463087,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024463088},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Anjali, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463089,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024463090},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463091,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024463092},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463093,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463079,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463079,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463082,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463089,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463091,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463093,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u49-mus9q0af":{"id":"universe-u49-mus9q0af","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463095},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463095,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463095,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463095,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u50-mus9q0ah":{"id":"universe-u50-mus9q0ah","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463097},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463097,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463097,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463097,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u51-mus9q0aj":{"id":"universe-u51-mus9q0aj","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 12 of us planning manali for a college trip, is it available?","t":1791024463099},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 12 people the total is ₹1,50,000. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 12 seats?","t":1791024463103,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024463105},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Manali has 17 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024463110,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024463112},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. To hold 12 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024463113,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024463114},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Yes, of course. Ask me anything else; reply \"hold\" when you want the seats held.","t":1791024463124,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024463126},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. To hold 12 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024463126,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463099,"said":{"group":12,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463099,"text":"hi, 12 of us planning manali for a college trip, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463105,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463112,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463114,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463126,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u52-mus9q0bc":{"id":"universe-u52-mus9q0bc","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 6 લોકો માટે, long vacation, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024463128},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 6 logon ka total ₹87,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463131,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024463134},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463144,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024463145},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463146,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024463148},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463148,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","t":1791024463150},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Rahul, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463150,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024463151},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463152,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463128,"said":{"group":6,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463128,"text":"ગોવા 6 લોકો માટે, long vacation, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463134,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463146,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463148,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463150,"text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463152,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u53-mus9q0c1":{"id":"universe-u53-mus9q0c1","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024463153},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463154,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024463156},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463156,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024463158},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463158,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024463160},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024463167,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024463168},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463169,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024463171},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463171,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"डिस्काउंट?","t":1791024463173},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Amit, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024463173,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","t":1791024463175},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463176,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","t":1791024463178},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463178,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463153,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463154,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463156,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463158,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463160,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463169,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463171,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463173,"text":"डिस्काउंट?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463175,"text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463178,"text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u54-mus9q0cs":{"id":"universe-u54-mus9q0cs","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463180},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463181,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463180,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463181,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u55-mus9q0cv":{"id":"universe-u55-mus9q0cv","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 15 लोगों के लिए, college trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024463183},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 15 logon ka total ₹1,87,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463188,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024463190},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. 15 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463195,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024463197},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463205,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024463207},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463208,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024463209},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463210,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463183,"said":{"group":15,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463183,"text":"मनाली 15 लोगों के लिए, college trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463190,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463197,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463207,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463209,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u56-mus9q0dn":{"id":"universe-u56-mus9q0dn","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","t":1791024463211},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024463215,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463211,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463212,"text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u57-mus9q0dt":{"id":"universe-u57-mus9q0dt","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 25 log, long vacation ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024463217},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Manali plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Solang; D3 Atal Tunnel; D4 Old Manali cafes; D5 breakfast, last stop, return. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 25 logon ka total ₹3,12,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463221,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 25","t":1791024463223},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463224,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024463225},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463226,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024463227},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463228,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024463229},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463230,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg khana milega?","t":1791024463232},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463232,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463217,"said":{"group":25,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024463217,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 25 log, long vacation ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463223,"text":"hold karo 25","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463225,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463227,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463230,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463232,"text":"veg khana milega?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u58-mus9q0ea":{"id":"universe-u58-mus9q0ea","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 4 लोगों के लिए, bachelor trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024463234},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹58,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463238,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024463239},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463245,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024463247},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463254,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024463256},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463256,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"डिस्काउंट?","t":1791024463258},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Karan, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai.","t":1791024463258,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024463260},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Karan, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463260,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024463262},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463263,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463234,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463234,"text":"गोवा 4 लोगों के लिए, bachelor trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463240,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463247,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463256,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463258,"text":"डिस्काउंट?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463260,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463262,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u59-mus9q0f4":{"id":"universe-u59-mus9q0f4","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463264},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463265,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463264,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463265,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u60-mus9q0f7":{"id":"universe-u60-mus9q0f7","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hello","t":1791024463267},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463267,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kuch info chahiye","t":1791024463269},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463274,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip ka kya hai?","t":1791024463276},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Rohan, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463283,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024463285},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463287,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024463288},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463300,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024463302},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Rohan, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463314,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463267,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463267,"text":"hello","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463269,"text":"kuch info chahiye","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463277,"text":"trip ka kya hai?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463286,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463289,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463302,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u61-mus9q0gk":{"id":"universe-u61-mus9q0gk","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 15 लोगों के लिए, college trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024463316},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 15 logon ka total ₹1,87,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463320,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 15","t":1791024463322},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463322,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024463324},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463325,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024463327},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463327,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463316,"said":{"group":15,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463316,"text":"मनाली 15 लोगों के लिए, college trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463322,"text":"hold karo 15","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463325,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463327,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u62-mus9q0gx":{"id":"universe-u62-mus9q0gx","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 6 लोगों के लिए, long vacation, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024463329},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 6 logon ka total ₹87,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463332,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 6","t":1791024463334},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463335,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024463337},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463337,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024463339},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463340,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463329,"said":{"group":6,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463329,"text":"गोवा 6 लोगों के लिए, long vacation, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463334,"text":"hold karo 6","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463337,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463339,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u63-mus9q0h9":{"id":"universe-u63-mus9q0h9","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463341},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463342,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463341,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463342,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u64-mus9q0hc":{"id":"universe-u64-mus9q0hc","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 4 of us planning goa for a pilgrimage, is it available?","t":1791024463344},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 4 people the total is ₹58,000. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 4 seats?","t":1791024463348,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024463349},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024463355,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024463357},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. To hold 4 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024463357,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024463359},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. To hold 4 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024463360,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024463361},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. To hold 4 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024463362,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"i need to ask my wife","t":1791024463364},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Riya, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024463377,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463344,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024463344,"text":"hi, 4 of us planning goa for a pilgrimage, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463350,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463357,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463359,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463362,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463364,"text":"i need to ask my wife","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u65-mus9q0ib":{"id":"universe-u65-mus9q0ib","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"yeh promise nahi tha, captain rude tha. refund chahiye","t":1791024463379},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024463382,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463379,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463380,"text":"yeh promise nahi tha, captain rude tha. refund chahiye","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u66-mus9q0ig":{"id":"universe-u66-mus9q0ig","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024463384},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463385,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024463386},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463393,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024463395},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463396,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024463397},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463398,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024463400},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463400,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"i need to ask my wife","t":1791024463402},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Of course, take your time.","t":1791024463416,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024463418},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463419,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463384,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463384,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463387,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463395,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463398,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463400,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463402,"text":"i need to ask my wife","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463419,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u67-mus9q0jh":{"id":"universe-u67-mus9q0jh","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463421},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within