ha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463456,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024463458},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Neha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463459,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024463460},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463461,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463453,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463453,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463456,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463458,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463461,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u72-mus9q0kn":{"id":"universe-u72-mus9q0kn","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 9 लोगों के लिए, workation, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024463463},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 9 logon ka total ₹1,30,500. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463466,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024463468},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463473,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024463476},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463476,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024463478},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463478,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024463480},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463481,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","t":1791024463483},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Amit, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463483,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463463,"said":{"group":9,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463463,"text":"गोवा 9 लोगों के लिए, workation, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463468,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463476,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463478,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463481,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463483,"text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u73-mus9q0l9":{"id":"universe-u73-mus9q0l9","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 24 log, birthday or anniversary ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024463485},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Manali plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Solang; D3 Atal Tunnel; D4 Old Manali cafes; D5 breakfast, last stop, return. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 24 logon ka total ₹3,00,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463489,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024463491},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. 24 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463500,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024463502},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463510,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024463512},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463513,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024463515},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463515,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024463517},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463517,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"24 logon ke liye discount?","t":1791024463519},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Sameer, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. 24 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do.","t":1791024463537,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463485,"said":{"group":24,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463485,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 24 log, birthday or anniversary ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463491,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463502,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463512,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463515,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463517,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463519,"text":"24 logon ke liye discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u74-mus9q0mr":{"id":"universe-u74-mus9q0mr","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","t":1791024463539},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024463543,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463539,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463539,"text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u75-mus9q0mx":{"id":"universe-u75-mus9q0mx","messages":[{"