nd the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463559,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463559,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463559,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u80-mus9q0nd":{"id":"universe-u80-mus9q0nd","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463561},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463562,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463561,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463562,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u81-mus9q0ng":{"id":"universe-u81-mus9q0ng","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463564},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463564,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463564,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463564,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u82-mus9q0ni":{"id":"universe-u82-mus9q0ni","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463566},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463566,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463566,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463566,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u83-mus9q0nl":{"id":"universe-u83-mus9q0nl","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463569},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463569,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463569,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463569,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u84-mus9q0nn":{"id":"universe-u84-mus9q0nn","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463571},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463572,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463571,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463571,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u85-mus9q0nq":{"id":"universe-u85-mus9q0nq","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463574},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463574,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463574,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463574,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u86-mus9q0ns":{"id":"universe-u86-mus9q0ns","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 1 of us planning goa for a workation, is it available?","t":1791024463576},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold one?","t":1791024463580,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024463582},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹17,400. Advance now and balance 7 days before departure makes it easier. To hold a seat, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024463588,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 1 seat","t":1791024463590},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463590,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024463592},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463593,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"any discount for 1?","t":1791024463595},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹17,400. Advance now and balance 7 days before departure makes it easier. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463607,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463576,"said":{"group":1,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463576,"text":"hi, 1 of us planning goa for a workation, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463583,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463590,"text":"ok hold 1 seat","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463593,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463595,"text":"any discount for 1?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u87-mus9q0op":{"id":"universe-u87-mus9q0op","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 14 of us planning manali for a college trip, is it available?","t":1791024463609},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 14 people the total is ₹1,75,000. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 14 seats?","t":1791024463615,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 14 seats","t":1791024463617},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Manali 20 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463617,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024463620},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463620,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024463622},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463623,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024463625},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463625,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463609,"said":{"group":14,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463609,"text":"hi, 14 of us planning manali for a college trip, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463617,"text":"ok hold 14 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463620,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463622,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463625,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u88-mus9q0p7":{"id":"universe-u88-mus9q0p7","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 17 log, workation ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024463627},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Beaches; D3 Nightlife; D4 breakfast, last stop, return. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 17 logon ka total ₹2,46,500. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463631,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024463633},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463640,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024463642},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463643,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024463645},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463645,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024463647},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Vikram, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463660,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","t":1791024463662},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463663,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463627,"said":{"group":17,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463627,"text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 17 log, workation ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463634,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463642,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463645,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463648,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463662,"text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u89-mus9q0q9":{"id":"universe-u89-mus9q0q9","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 2 log, workation ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024463665},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Manali plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Solang; D3 Atal Tunnel; D4 Old Manali cafes; D5 breakfast, last stop, return. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹25,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463669,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024463673},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463680,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024463682},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463690,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024463693},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463693,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024463695},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463696,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"2 logon ke liye discount?","t":1791024463698},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Rahul, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai.","t":1791024463714,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024463716},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Haan, bilkul. Rahul, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463736,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463665,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463665,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 2 log, workation ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463673,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463682,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463693,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463695,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463698,"text":"2 logon ke liye discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463716,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u90-mus9q0sa":{"id":"universe-u90-mus9q0sa","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 1 of us planning goa for a weekend escape, is it available?","t":1791024463738},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Goa departs 12 Dec, a Saturday (weekend), and returns 15 Dec, Tuesday. That is 2 days of leave for office-goers. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold one?","t":1791024463739,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 1 seat","t":1791024463741},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463742,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"i need to ask my wife","t":1791024463744},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024463752,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024463754},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. To hold a seat, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024463755,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463738,"said":{"group":1,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463739,"text":"hi, 1 of us planning goa for a weekend escape, is it available?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463742,"text":"ok hold 1 seat","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463744,"text":"i need to ask my wife","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463754,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u91-mus9q0st":{"id":"universe-u91-mus9q0st","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","t":1791024463757},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024463761,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463757,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463757,"text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u92-mus9q0sz":{"id":"universe-u92-mus9q0sz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 4 લોકો માટે, pilgrimage, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024463763},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹58,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463766,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 4","t":1791024463769},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463769,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024463771},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463772,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024463774},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463775,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463763,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463763,"text":"ગોવા 4 લોકો માટે, pilgrimage, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463769,"text":"hold karo 4","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463772,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463775,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u93-mus9q0td":{"id":"universe-u93-mus9q0td","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"મનાલી 4 લોકો માટે, family reunion, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024463777},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹50,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463780,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 4","t":1791024463782},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463783,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024463785},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463786,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024463788},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463788,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024463791},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463791,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બાળકો માટે ઠીક છે?","t":1791024463793},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Zyada traveller 20 se 40 ke hain; relaxed batches mein family aur parents welcome hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463794,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463777,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463777,"text":"મનાલી 4 લોકો માટે, family reunion, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463783,"text":"hold karo 4","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463785,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463788,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463791,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463793,"text":"બાળકો માટે ઠીક છે?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u94-mus9q0tw":{"id":"universe-u94-mus9q0tw","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463796},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463796,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463796,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463796,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u95-mus9q0ty":{"id":"universe-u95-mus9q0ty","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"यह वादा नहीं था, बस 3 घंटे लेट थी। रिफंड चाहिए","t":1791024463798},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024463801,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463798,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463799,"text":"यह वादा नहीं था, बस 3 घंटे लेट थी। रिफंड चाहिए","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u96-mus9q0u3":{"id":"universe-u96-mus9q0u3","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024463803},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463804,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024463806},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463807,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024463809},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463810,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024463812},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024463819,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024463821},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463822,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024463824},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463825,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024463827},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Amit, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024463827,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","t":1791024463829},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463830,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","t":1791024463833},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463833,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463803,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463804,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463806,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463809,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463812,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463822,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463824,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463827,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463830,"text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463833,"text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u97-mus9q0v0":{"id":"universe-u97-mus9q0v0","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463836},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463836,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463836,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463836,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u98-mus9q0v3":{"id":"universe-u98-mus9q0v3","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 6 of us planning goa for a weekend escape, is it available?","t":1791024463839},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Goa departs 12 Dec, a Saturday (weekend), and returns 15 Dec, Tuesday. That is 2 days of leave for office-goers. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 6 people the total is ₹87,000. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 6 seats?","t":1791024463839,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 6 seats","t":1791024463842},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463842,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024463845},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463845,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024463847},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463848,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024463850},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024463850,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","t":1791024463853},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. For seniors: great; we take an emergency contact and a medicine list, and the captain checks on them every day. If it helps, I can set up a 5 minute call with the founder before you decide. ","t":1791024463853,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463839,"said":{"group":6,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463839,"text":"hi, 6 of us planning goa for a weekend escape, is it available?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463842,"text":"ok hold 6 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463845,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463848,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463850,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463853,"text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u99-mus9q0vj":{"id":"universe-u99-mus9q0vj","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 5 log, birthday or anniversary ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024463855},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Manali plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Solang; D3 Atal Tunnel; D4 Old Manali cafes; D5 breakfast, last stop, return. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 5 logon ka total ₹62,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463861,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 5","t":1791024463864},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463864,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024463866},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463867,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463855,"said":{"group":5,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463855,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 5 log, birthday or anniversary ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463864,"text":"hold karo 5","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463867,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u100-mus9q0vx":{"id":"universe-u100-mus9q0vx","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024463869},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463870,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024463872},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463877,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024463879},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463880,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024463882},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, I get it. We take ₹4,500 as advance and the rest in two parts, and in a group of 6 or more the organiser travels free. Which trip are you looking at? I will find the cheapest batch that fits.","t":1791024463889,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024463892},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463892,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024463895},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463895,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463869,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463869,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463872,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463879,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463882,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463892,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463895,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u101-mus9q0wq":{"id":"universe-u101-mus9q0wq","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","t":1791024463898},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024463900,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463898,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463898,"text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u102-mus9q0wv":{"id":"universe-u102-mus9q0wv","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 5 log, long vacation ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024463903},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Goa plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Beaches; D3 Nightlife; D4 breakfast, last stop, return. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 5 logon ka total ₹72,500. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463907,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 5","t":1791024463909},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463910,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024463912},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463913,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024463915},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463916,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024463918},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463919,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg khana milega?","t":1791024463921},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024463921,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463903,"said":{"group":5,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024463903,"text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 5 log, long vacation ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463909,"text":"hold karo 5","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463913,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463915,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463918,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463921,"text":"veg khana milega?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u103-mus9q0xg":{"id":"universe-u103-mus9q0xg","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024463924},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463924,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463924,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463924,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u104-mus9q0xi":{"id":"universe-u104-mus9q0xi","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024463927},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463927,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024463930},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463935,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024463938},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Meera, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463938,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024463941},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463941,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024463944},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024463944,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463927,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463927,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463930,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463938,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463941,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463944,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u105-mus9q0y3":{"id":"universe-u105-mus9q0y3","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024463947},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463947,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024463950},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463950,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024463953},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024463954,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024463956},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024463963,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024463966},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463966,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024463968},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463969,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024463972},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463972,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024463974},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024463975,"auto":false}],"created":1791024463947,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024463947,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463950,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463953,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024463956,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463966,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463969,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463972,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024463975,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u106-mus9q0yx":{"id":"universe-u106-mus9q0yx","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 25 log, long vacation ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024463977},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Goa plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Beaches; D3 Nightlife; D4 breakfast, last stop, return. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 25 logon ka total ₹3,62,500. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024463981,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024463984},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024463992,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024463995},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency c