24464040},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464041,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024464043},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464044,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"बच्चों के लिए ठीक है?","t":1791024464046},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Zyada traveller 20 se 40 ke hain; relaxed batches mein family aur parents welcome hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464047,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464034,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464035,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464038,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464040,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464044,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464046,"text":"बच्चों के लिए ठीक है?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u110-mus9q10x":{"id":"universe-u110-mus9q10x","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464050},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464050,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464050,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464050,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u111-mus9q110":{"id":"universe-u111-mus9q110","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024464052},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464053,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024464055},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464056,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024464058},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464059,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024464061},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464062,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024464064},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464064,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024464067},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464067,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024464070},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464070,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464052,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464052,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464055,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464058,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464061,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464064,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464067,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464070,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u112-mus9q11l":{"id":"universe-u112-mus9q11l","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024464073},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464074,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024464076},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464077,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024464079},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464080,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024464082},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464083,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024464085},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464086,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024464090},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464091,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464073,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464073,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464076,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464079,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464082,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464086,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464091,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u113-mus9q126":{"id":"universe-u113-mus9q126","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024464094},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464094,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024464097},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464097,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024464100},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464101,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024464103},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464104,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","t":1791024464106},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464107,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024464109},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464110,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464094,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024464094,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464097,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464100,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464103,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464106,"text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464109,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u114-mus9q12o":{"id":"universe-u114-mus9q12o","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464112},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464112,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464112,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464112,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u115-mus9q12r":{"id":"universe-u115-mus9q12r","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024464115},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464116,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024464118},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464124,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024464127},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Priya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464127,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024464130},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464130,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024464133},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464134,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024464136},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464137,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464115,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464115,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464119,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464127,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464130,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464133,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464137,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u116-mus9q13f":{"id":"universe-u116-mus9q13f","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 10 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024464139},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 10 logon ka total ₹1,45,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464143,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 10","t":1791024464146},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464146,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024464149},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464150,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024464152},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464153,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","t":1791024464155},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464156,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464139,"said":{"group":10,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024464140,"text":"गोवा 10 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464146,"text":"hold karo 10","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464149,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464152,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464156,"text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u117-mus9q13y":{"id":"universe-u117-mus9q13y","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464158},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464159,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464158,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464159,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u118-mus9q141":{"id":"universe-u118-mus9q141","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024464161},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464162,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024464165},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464165,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024464168},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Sameer, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464169,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024464172},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464172,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024464175},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464175,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464161,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464162,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464165,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464168,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464172,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464175,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u119-mus9q14i":{"id":"universe-u119-mus9q14i","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"મનાલી 2 લોકો માટે, honeymoon, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024464178},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Congratulations! Haan, private double room couple ke liye mil jaata hai: supplement lagbhag ₹1,900 per person poore trip ka (exact figure hotel confirmation ke saath), baaki sab same, aur honeymoon ke liye room decor aur ek dinner table alag se, captain sambhal lega. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹25,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464178,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024464181},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464189,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024464192},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464202,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024464204},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464205,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024464209},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464209,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024464212},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464212,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024464215},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464215,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464178,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464178,"text":"મનાલી 2 લોકો માટે, honeymoon, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464181,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464192,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464205,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464209,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464212,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464215,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u120-mus9q15m":{"id":"universe-u120-mus9q15m","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","t":1791024464218},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024464221,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464218,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464218,"text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u121-mus9q15s":{"id":"universe-u121-mus9q15s","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hello","t":1791024464224},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464225,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kuch info chahiye","t":1791024464228},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464233,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip ka kya hai?","t":1791024464236},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Pooja, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464243,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024464246},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464246,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024464249},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464249,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024464252},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464267,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024464270},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464286,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464224,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464224,"text":"hello","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464228,"text":"kuch info chahiye","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464236,"text":"trip ka kya hai?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464246,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464249,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464252,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464270,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u122-mus9q17k":{"id":"universe-u122-mus9q17k","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","t":1791024464288},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024464291,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464288,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464289,"text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u123-mus9q17q":{"id":"universe-u123-mus9q17q","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","t":1791024464294},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024464297,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464294,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464294,"text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u124-mus9q17w":{"id":"universe-u124-mus9q17w","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464300},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464301,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464300,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464300,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u125-mus9q17z":{"id":"universe-u125-mus9q17z","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 3 log, birthday or anniversary ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024464303},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Manali plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Solang; D3 Atal Tunnel; D4 Old Manali cafes; D5 breakfast, last stop, return. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 3 logon ka total ₹37,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464307,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024464310},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464318,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 3","t":1791024464321},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464322,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024464324},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464325,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024464327},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464328,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"3 logon ke liye discount?","t":1791024464330},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464347,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464303,"said":{"group":3,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464303,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 3 log, birthday or anniversary ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464310,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464321,"text":"hold karo 3","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464325,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464327,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464331,"text":"3 logon ke liye discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u126-mus9q19a":{"id":"universe-u126-mus9q19a","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 3 of us planning goa for a weekend escape, is it available?","t":1791024464350},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa departs 12 Dec, a Saturday (weekend), and returns 15 Dec, Tuesday. That is 2 days of leave for office-goers. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 3 people the total is ₹43,500. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 3 seats?","t":1791024464350,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 3 seats","t":1791024464353},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464354,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024464356},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024464357,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024464359},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024464360,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024464363},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024464363,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","t":1791024464366},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. For seniors: great; we take an emergency contact and a medicine list, and the captain checks on them every day. If it helps, I can set up a 5 minute call with the founder before you decide. ","t":1791024464366,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464350,"said":{"group":3,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464350,"text":"hi, 3 of us planning goa for a weekend escape, is it available?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464353,"text":"ok hold 3 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464357,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464360,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464363,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464366,"text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u127-mus9q19t":{"id":"universe-u127-mus9q19t","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024464369},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464370,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024464372},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464373,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024464375},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464376,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024464379},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464379,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024464382},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Arjun, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464382,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024464385},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Arjun, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464386,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464369,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464369,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464372,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464376,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464379,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464382,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464386,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u128-mus9q1ad":{"id":"universe-u128-mus9q1ad","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464389},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464389,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464389,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464389,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u129-mus9q1ag":{"id":"universe-u129-mus9q1ag","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"yeh promise nahi tha, hotel photo jaisa bilkul nahi tha. refund chahiye","t":1791024464392},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024464395,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464392,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464392,"text":"yeh promise nahi tha, hotel photo jaisa bilkul nahi tha. refund chahiye","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u130-mus9q1am":{"id":"universe-u130-mus9q1am","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 12 લોકો માટે, bachelor trip, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024464398},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 12 logon ka total ₹1,74,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464402,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 12","t":1791024464404},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464405,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024464408},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464408,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024464411},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464411,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464398,"said":{"group":12,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464398,"text":"ગોવા 12 લોકો માટે, bachelor trip, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464405,"text":"hold karo 12","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464408,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464411,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u131-mus9q1b3":{"id":"universe-u131-mus9q1b3","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 10 लोगों के लिए, family reunion, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024464415},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 10 logon ka total ₹1,25,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464418,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024464421},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464427,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024464430},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464430,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024464433},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464433,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024464438},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464438,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024464441},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Kavya, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464441,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464415,"said":{"group":10,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024464415,"text":"मनाली 10 लोगों के लिए, family reunion, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464421,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464430,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464433,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464438,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464441,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u132-mus9q1bw":{"id":"universe-u132-mus9q1bw","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464444},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464444,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464444,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464444,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u133-mus9q1bz":{"id":"universe-u133-mus9q1bz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464447},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464448,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464447,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464447,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u134-mus9q1c2":{"id":"universe-u134-mus9q1c2","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 12 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024464450},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa 12 Dec ko Saturday ko nikalta hai (weekend) aur 15 Dec Tuesday ko wapas. Office walon ko 2 din ki chhutti lagegi. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 12 logon ka total ₹1,74,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464451,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024464454},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. 12 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464460,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024464463},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464471,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024464474},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464474,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024464477},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Vikram, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. 12 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do.","t":1791024464478,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024464480},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464481,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464450,"said":{"group":12,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464451,"text":"ગોવા 12 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464454,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464463,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464474,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464477,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464480,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u135-mus9q1cz":{"id":"universe-u135-mus9q1cz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 5 of us planning manali for a pilgrimage, is it available?","t":1791024464483},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 5 people the total is ₹62,500. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 5 seats?","t":1791024464487,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024464490},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Manali has 17 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024464496,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024464498},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. To hold 5 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024464499,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024464502},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. To hold 5 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024464502,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024464505},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. To hold 5 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024464505,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","t":1791024464508},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. For seniors: good; we take an emergency contact and a medicine list, and the captain checks on them every day. If it helps, I can set up a 5 minute call with the founder before you decide. ","t":1791024464509,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464483,"said":{"group":5,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464484,"text":"hi, 5 of us planning manali for a pilgrimage, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464490,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464499,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464502,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464505,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464508,"text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u136-mus9q1ds":{"id":"universe-u136-mus9q1ds","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464512},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464512,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464512,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464512,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u137-mus9q1dw":{"id":"universe-u137-mus9q1dw","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024464516},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464516,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024464520},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464525,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024464528},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Priya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464529,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024464533},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, I get it. We take ₹4,500 as advance and the rest in two parts, and in a group of 6 or more the organiser travels free. Which trip are you looking at? I will find the cheapest batch that fits.","t":1791024464541,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024464543},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464544,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024464547},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464547,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024464550},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464551,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"any discount for 4?","t":1791024464554},{"role":"clan","text":"In short: Priya, I get it. We take ₹4,500 as advance and the rest in two parts, and in a group of 6 or more the organiser travels free.","t":1791024464572,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464516,"said":{"regroup":false,"group":4},"intents":[{"t":1791024464516,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464520,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464528,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464533,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464544,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464547,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464551,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464554,"text":"any discount for 4?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u138-mus9q1fk":{"id":"universe-u138-mus9q1fk","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 2 લોકો માટે, honeymoon, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024464577},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Congratulations! Haan, private double room couple ke liye mil jaata hai: supplement lagbhag ₹2,200 per person poore trip ka (exact figure hotel confirmation ke saath), baaki sab same, aur honeymoon ke liye room decor aur ek dinner table alag se, captain sambhal lega. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹29,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464577,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 2","t":1791024464580},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464581,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024464584},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464584,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024464587},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464587,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024464590},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024464591,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464577,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464577,"text":"ગોવા 2 લોકો માટે, honeymoon, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464580,"text":"hold karo 2","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464584,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464587,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464590,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u139-mus9q1g2":{"id":"universe-u139-mus9q1g2","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024464594},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464594,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024464598},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464603,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024464606},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Priya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464606,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024464610},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464610,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024464613},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464614,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464594,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464594,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464598,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464606,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464610,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464613,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u140-mus9q1gp":{"id":"universe-u140-mus9q1gp","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hello","t":1791024464617},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464617,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kuch info chahiye","t":1791024464621},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464626,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip ka kya hai?","t":1791024464629},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464635,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024464638},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464639,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024464642},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464642,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"group se pooch ke batata hoon","t":1791024464645},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464660,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"group se pooch ke batata hoon","t":1791024464663},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464679,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","t":1791024464682},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464683,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464617,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464617,"text":"hello","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464621,"text":"kuch info chahiye","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464629,"text":"trip ka kya hai?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464639,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464642,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464645,"text":"group se pooch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464663,"text":"group se pooch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464683,"text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u141-mus9q1im":{"id":"universe-u141-mus9q1im","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024464686},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464686,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024464689},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464690,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024464693},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464693,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024464696},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024464708,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024464711},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464712,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"डिस्काउंट?","t":1791024464715},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Anjali, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024464715,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464686,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464686,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464690,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464693,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464697,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464711,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464715,"text":"डिस्काउंट?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u142-mus9q1jl":{"id":"universe-u142-mus9q1jl","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464721},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464721,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464721,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464721,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u143-mus9q1jp":{"id":"universe-u143-mus9q1jp","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","t":1791024464725},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024464727,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464725,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464725,"text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u144-mus9q1jv":{"id":"universe-u144-mus9q1jv","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464731},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464731,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464731,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464731,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u145-mus9q1jz":{"id":"universe-u145-mus9q1jz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","t":1791024464735},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024464739,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464735,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464735,"text":"this is not what was promised, the bus was 3 hours late. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u146-mus9q1k7":{"id":"universe-u146-mus9q1k7","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024464743},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464744,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024464747},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464753,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024464756},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Anjali, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464756,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024464760},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464760,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024464763},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464764,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024464767},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464767,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464743,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024464743,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464747,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464756,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464760,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464763,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464767,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u147-mus9q1kz":{"id":"universe-u147-mus9q1kz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hello","t":1791024464771},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464771,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kuch info chahiye","t":1791024464774},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464780,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip ka kya hai?","t":1791024464783},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Meera, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464790,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024464793},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464794,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024464798},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024464798,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024464802},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464817,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024464820},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Meera, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464837,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464771,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464771,"text":"hello","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464775,"text":"kuch info chahiye","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464783,"text":"trip ka kya hai?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464794,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464798,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464802,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464821,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u148-mus9q1mw":{"id":"universe-u148-mus9q1mw","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 5 log, adventure ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024464840},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Goa plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Beaches; D3 Nightlife; D4 breakfast, last stop, return. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 5 logon ka total ₹72,500. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464844,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024464847},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464855,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024464859},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464859,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024464862},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464863,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464840,"said":{"group":5,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464840,"text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 5 log, adventure ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464847,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464859,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464863,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u149-mus9q1nm":{"id":"universe-u149-mus9q1nm","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464866},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464866,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464866,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464866,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u150-mus9q1np":{"id":"universe-u150-mus9q1np","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","t":1791024464869},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024464873,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464869,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464870,"text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u151-mus9q1nw":{"id":"universe-u151-mus9q1nw","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024464876},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464877,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024464880},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464885,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024464888},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Kavya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464889,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024464892},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464893,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024464896},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464896,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","t":1791024464900},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. For seniors: relaxed pace, ground-floor room, the captain stays close; we take an emergency contact and a medicine list, and the captain checks on them every day. If it helps, I can set up a 5 minute call with the founder before you decide. ","t":1791024464900,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024464904},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464904,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464876,"said":{"regroup":false,"group":2,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024464876,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464880,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464889,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464893,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464896,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464900,"text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464904,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u152-mus9q1os":{"id":"universe-u152-mus9q1os","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024464908},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024464908,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464908,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464908,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u153-mus9q1ow":{"id":"universe-u153-mus9q1ow","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"મનાલી 8 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024464912},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Manali 20 Dec ko Sunday ko nikalta hai (weekend) aur 24 Dec Thursday ko wapas. Office walon ko 4 din ki chhutti lagegi. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 8 logon ka total ₹1,00,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464912,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024464916},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464922,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024464926},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464926,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024464929},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464929,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024464932},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464933,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"પત્ની ને પૂછવું પડશે","t":1791024464936},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Meera, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464936,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464912,"said":{"group":8,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464912,"text":"મનાલી 8 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464916,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464926,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464929,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464933,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464936,"text":"પત્ની ને પૂછવું પડશે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u154-mus9q1po":{"id":"universe-u154-mus9q1po","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 15 log, pilgrimage ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024464940},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Goa plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Beaches; D3 Nightlife; D4 breakfast, last stop, return. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 15 logon ka total ₹2,17,500. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024464944,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024464947},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464954,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024464957},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464957,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024464961},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464961,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg khana milega?","t":1791024464966},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464966,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024464970},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Neha, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024464984,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464940,"said":{"group":15,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024464940,"text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 15 log, pilgrimage ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464947,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024464957,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464961,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464966,"text":"veg khana milega?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024464970,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u155-mus9q1qz":{"id":"universe-u155-mus9q1qz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"yeh promise nahi tha, captain rude tha. refund chahiye","t":1791024464987},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024464990,"auto":false}],"created":1791024464987,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024464988,"text":"yeh promise nahi tha, captain rude tha. refund chahiye","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u156-mus9q1r5":{"id":"universe-u156-mus9q1r5","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024464993},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024464994,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024464998},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465004,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024465008},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Vikram, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465008,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024465012},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465012,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024465016},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked opti