"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024465137},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024465137,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","t":1791024465140},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024465141,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465126,"said":{"group":15,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024465126,"text":"મનાલી 15 લોકો માટે, pilgrimage, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465133,"text":"hold karo 15","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465137,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465141,"text":"શાકાહારી જમવાનું?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u166-mus9q1vc":{"id":"universe-u166-mus9q1vc","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024465144},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465145,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024465148},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465153,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024465157},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Neha, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465157,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024465161},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465161,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024465165},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465165,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024465170},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465170,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465144,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024465144,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465148,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465157,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465161,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465165,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465170,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u167-mus9q1w6":{"id":"universe-u167-mus9q1w6","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024465174},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465175,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024465178},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465179,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024465183},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465183,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024465187},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465187,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024465193},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465193,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465174,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465175,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465179,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465183,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465187,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465193,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u168-mus9q1ws":{"id":"universe-u168-mus9q1ws","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","t":1791024465196},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024465199,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465196,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465197,"text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u169-mus9q1wz":{"id":"universe-u169-mus9q1wz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 3 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024465203},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 3 logon ka total ₹37,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024465206,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024465210},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024465216,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 3","t":1791024465219},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465220,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024465224},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024465224,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024465228},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024465228,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465203,"said":{"group":3,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465203,"text":"मनाली 3 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465210,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465219,"text":"hold karo 3","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465224,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465228,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u170-mus9q1xs":{"id":"universe-u170-mus9q1xs","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"yeh promise nahi tha, bus 3 ghante late thi. refund chahiye","t":1791024465232},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024465235,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465232,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465232,"text":"yeh promise nahi tha, bus 3 ghante late thi. refund chahiye","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u171-mus9q1xz":{"id":"universe-u171-mus9q1xz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024465239},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465239,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465239,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465239,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u172-mus9q1y3":{"id":"universe-u172-mus9q1y3","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024465243},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465243,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024465247},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465248,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024465251},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Karan, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465252,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024465255},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024465263,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024465268},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465268,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024465272},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465272,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024465276},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465276,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024465280},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Karan, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024465280,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465243,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465243,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465247,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465251,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465256,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465268,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465272,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465276,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465280,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u173-mus9q1z8":{"id":"universe-u173-mus9q1z8","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hello","t":1791024465284},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465285,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kuch info chahiye","t":1791024465288},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465293,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip ka kya hai?","t":1791024465297},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Kavya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465303,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024465309},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024465316,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024465319},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465320,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"4 logon ke liye discount?","t":1791024465323},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Kavya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024465335,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","t":1791024465339},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465339,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465284,"said":{"regroup":false,"group":4},"intents":[{"t":1791024465284,"text":"hello","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465288,"text":"kuch info chahiye","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465297,"text":"trip ka kya hai?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465309,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465319,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465323,"text":"4 logon ke liye discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465339,"text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u174-mus9q20v":{"id":"universe-u174-mus9q20v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 16 of us planning goa for a pilgrimage, is it available?","t":1791024465343},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 16 people the total is ₹2,32,000. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 16 seats?","t":1791024465347,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 16 seats","t":1791024465351},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465351,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024465355},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465355,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024465358},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465359,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024465362},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465363,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024465366},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Yes, of course. Ask me anything else; reply \"hold\" when you want the seats held.","t":1791024465381,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465343,"said":{"group":16,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024465343,"text":"hi, 16 of us planning goa for a pilgrimage, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465351,"text":"ok hold 16 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465355,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465359,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465363,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465367,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u175-mus9q221":{"id":"universe-u175-mus9q221","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 17 of us planning manali for a bachelor trip, is it available?","t":1791024465385},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 17 people the total is ₹2,12,500. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 17 seats?","t":1791024465389,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 17 seats","t":1791024465392},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Manali 20 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465393,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024465397},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465397,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024465400},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465401,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024465404},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465405,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465385,"said":{"group":17,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465385,"text":"hi, 17 of us planning manali for a bachelor trip, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465393,"text":"ok hold 17 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465397,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465401,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465404,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u176-mus9q22o":{"id":"universe-u176-mus9q22o","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024465408},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465409,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024465412},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465413,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024465416},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465417,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024465421},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465422,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024465427},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465428,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024465431},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465432,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465408,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465408,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465413,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465417,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465422,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465427,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465432,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u177-mus9q23f":{"id":"universe-u177-mus9q23f","