ahi. 6 logon ka total ₹75,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024465507,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 6","t":1791024465511},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465511,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024465515},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024465515,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024465519},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024465519,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465506,"said":{"group":6,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465506,"text":"मनाली 6 लोगों के लिए, weekend escape, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465511,"text":"hold karo 6","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465515,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465519,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u180-mus9q25v":{"id":"universe-u180-mus9q25v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 7 of us planning goa for a college trip, is it available?","t":1791024465523},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 7 people the total is ₹1,01,500. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 7 seats?","t":1791024465528,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t