old 7 seats? Ask me anything else; reply \"hold\" when you want the seats held.","t":1791024465591,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465523,"said":{"group":7,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465523,"text":"hi, 7 of us planning goa for a college trip, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465533,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465543,"text":"ok hold 7 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465547,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465551,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465555,"text":"any discount for 7?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465573,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u181-mus9q27v":{"id":"universe-u181-mus9q27v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024465595},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465596,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465595,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465595,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u182-mus9q27z":{"id":"universe-u182-mus9q27z","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024465599},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465599,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465599,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465599,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u183-mus9q283":{"id":"universe-u183-mus9q283","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024465603},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465604,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465603,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465603,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u184-mus9q287":{"id":"universe-u184-mus9q287","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 5 of us planning goa for a adventure, is it available?","t":1791024465607},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 5 people the total is ₹72,500. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 5 seats?","t":1791024465612,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 5 seats","t":1791024465615},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465616,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024465620},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465620,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024465624},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465624,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024465628},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465628,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024465632},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465632,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465607,"said":{"group":5,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465608,"text":"hi, 5 of us planning goa for a adventure, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465615,"text":"ok hold 5 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465620,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465624,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465628,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465632,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u185-mus9q290":{"id":"universe-u185-mus9q290","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","t":1791024465636},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024465640,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465636,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465636,"text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u186-mus9q298":{"id":"universe-u186-mus9q298","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","t":1791024465644},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024465648,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465644,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465644,"text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u187-mus9q29g":{"id":"universe-u187-mus9q29g","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"yeh promise nahi tha, room ganda tha. refund chahiye","t":1791024465652},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024465655,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465652,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465652,"text":"yeh promise nahi tha, room ganda tha. refund chahiye","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u188-mus9q29p":{"id":"universe-u188-mus9q29p","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024465661},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465661,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024465665},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465665,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024465669},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465670,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024465674},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024465680,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024465684},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465685,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024465688},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465689,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465661,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465661,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465665,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465669,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465674,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465684,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465689,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u189-mus9q2al":{"id":"universe-u189-mus9q2al","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024465693},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465693,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024465697},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465703,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024465706},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Amit, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465707,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024465711},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465711,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024465715},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465716,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024465720},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Amit, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465735,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024465738},{"role":"clan","text":"Once more: Amit, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465755,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024465759},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and