e waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465777,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024465781},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465781,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024465787},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024465787,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465768,"said":{"group":6,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465768,"text":"hi, 6 of us planning manali for a bachelor trip, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465777,"text":"ok hold 6 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465781,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465787,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u192-mus9q2db":{"id":"universe-u192-mus9q2db","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024465791},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465791,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465791,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465791,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u193-mus9q2df":{"id":"universe-u193-mus9q2df","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"મનાલી 3 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024465795},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Manali 20 Dec ko Sunday ko nikalta hai (weekend) aur 24 Dec Thursday ko wapas. Office walon ko 4 din ki chhutti lagegi. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 3 logon ka total ₹37,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024465796,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024465800},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024465806,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 3","t":1791024465810},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465811,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024465814},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024465815,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024465818},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024465819,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024465823},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024465823,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024465827},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024465827,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465795,"said":{"group":3,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465795,"text":"મનાલી 3 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465800,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465810,"text":"hold karo 3","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465815,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465819,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465823,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465827,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u194-mus9q2ef":{"id":"universe-u194-mus9q2ef","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024465831},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465832,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024465835},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465836,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024465840},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465840,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024465844},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465845,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024465849},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465849,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024465853},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465854,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024465858},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465858,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465831,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465831,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465836,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465840,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465845,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465849,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465853,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465858,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u195-mus9q2fa":{"id":"universe-u195-mus9q2fa","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024465862},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465862,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024465867},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465873,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024465877},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Amit, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465877,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024465881},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465882,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024465885},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465886,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024465889},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465890,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024465894},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465894,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465862,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465862,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465867,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465877,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465881,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465885,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465890,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465894,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u196-mus9q2ga":{"id":"universe-u196-mus9q2ga","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024465898},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465898,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465898,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465898,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u197-mus9q2ge":{"id":"universe-u197-mus9q2ge","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024465902},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465903,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024465907},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465907,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024465911},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465911,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024465915},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024465922,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024465926},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465926,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024465930},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465931,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024465934},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465935,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"डिस्काउंट?","t":1791024465938},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Priya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024465939,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465902,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465903,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465907,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465911,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465916,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465926,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465931,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465935,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465939,"text":"डिस्काउंट?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u198-mus9q2hj":{"id":"universe-u198-mus9q2hj","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024465943},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465943,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465943,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465943,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u199-mus9q2hn":{"id":"universe-u199-mus9q2hn","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024465947},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465947,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024465952},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465953,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024465956},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465957,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024465961},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465961,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024465965},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465965,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024465969},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024465970,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465947,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024465947,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465953,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465957,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465961,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465965,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465969,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u200-mus9q2ie":{"id":"universe-u200-mus9q2ie","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024465974},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465974,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465974,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465974,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u201-mus9q2ii":{"id":"universe-u201-mus9q2ii","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024465978},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465978,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024465982},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465988,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024465992},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Sneha, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024465992,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024465996},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024465996,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024466000},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466001,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024466005},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466005,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for kids aged 6 and 9?","t":1791024466009},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466009,"auto":false}],"created":1791024465978,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024465978,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024465983,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465992,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024465996,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466001,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466005,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466009,"text":"is it ok for kids aged 6 and 9?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u202-mus9q2jh":{"id":"universe-u202-mus9q2jh","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024466013},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466014,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466013,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466013,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u203-mus9q2jl":{"id":"universe-u203-mus9q2jl","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 9 लोगों के लिए, college trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024466017},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 9 logon ka total ₹1,12,500. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466021,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 9","t":1791024466024},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466025,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024466030},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466031,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024466035},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466035,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024466039},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466039,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466017,"said":{"group":9,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466017,"text":"मनाली 9 लोगों के लिए, college trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466025,"text":"hold karo 9","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466030,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466035,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466039,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u204-mus9q2kb":{"id":"universe-u204-mus9q2kb","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024466043},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and pric