ી ને પૂછવું પડશે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u208-mus9q2mg":{"id":"universe-u208-mus9q2mg","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","t":1791024466120},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024466124,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466120,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466121,"text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u209-mus9q2mo":{"id":"universe-u209-mus9q2mo","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024466128},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466129,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024466133},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466139,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024466143},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Karan, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466143,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024466147},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466148,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024466152},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466152,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024466157},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466158,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024466162},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466162,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466128,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024466129,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466134,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466143,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466147,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466152,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466157,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466162,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u210-mus9q2nq":{"id":"universe-u210-mus9q2nq","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"यह वादा नहीं था, बस 3 घंटे लेट थी। रिफंड चाहिए","t":1791024466166},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024466169,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466166,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466167,"text":"यह वादा नहीं था, बस 3 घंटे लेट थी। रिफंड चाहिए","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u211-mus9q2nx":{"id":"universe-u211-mus9q2nx","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024466173},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466174,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466173,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466173,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u212-mus9q2o2":{"id":"universe-u212-mus9q2o2","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 6 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024466178},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 6 logon ka total ₹87,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466181,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 6","t":1791024466185},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466185,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024466189},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466190,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024466195},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466196,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466178,"said":{"group":6,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024466178,"text":"गोवा 6 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466185,"text":"hold karo 6","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466190,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466195,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u213-mus9q2oo":{"id":"universe-u213-mus9q2oo","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024466200},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466200,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024466204},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466210,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024466214},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Dev, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466214,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024466218},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466218,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024466222},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me th