ित है?","t":1791024466248},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466248,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"बच्चों के लिए ठीक है?","t":1791024466252},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Zyada traveller 20 se 40 ke hain; relaxed batches mein family aur parents welcome hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466252,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024466256},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466257,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024466261},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466262,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024466266},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466266,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466234,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466234,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466239,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466243,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466248,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466252,"text":"बच्चों के लिए ठीक है?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466257,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466261,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466266,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u216-mus9q2qn":{"id":"universe-u216-mus9q2qn","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 14 of us planning goa for a long vacation, is it available?","t":1791024466271},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 14 people the total is ₹2,03,000. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 14 seats?","t":1791024466275,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024466281},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024466286,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024466290},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. To hold 14 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024466291,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024466295},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. To hold 14 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024466295,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"i need to ask my wife","t":1791024466300},{"role":"clan","text":"In short: Rahul, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024466311,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024466316},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. To hold 14 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024466316,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466271,"said":{"group":14,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466271,"text":"hi, 14 of us planning goa for a long vacation, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466281,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466291,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466295,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466300,"text":"i need to ask my wife","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466316,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u217-mus9q2s0":{"id":"universe-u217-mus9q2s0","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 4 log, family reunion ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024466320},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Manali plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Solang; D3 Atal Tunnel; D4 Old Manali cafes; D5 breakfast, last stop, return. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹50,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466324,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024466328},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466335,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024466339},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466340,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024466344},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466344,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg khana milega?","t":1791024466348},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466349,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"group se pooch ke batata hoon","t":1791024466353},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Amit, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466367,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466320,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024466321,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 4 log, family reunion ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466329,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466339,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466344,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466349,"text":"veg khana milega?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466353,"text":"group se pooch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u218-mus9q2tf":{"id":"universe-u218-mus9q2tf","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","t":1791024466371},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024466373,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466371,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466371,"text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u219-mus9q2tl":{"id":"universe-u219-mus9q2tl","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024466377},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466378,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024466382},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466387,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024466392},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Rahul, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466393,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024466401},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466402,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024466408},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466408,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024466414},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Rahul, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466432,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024466438},{"role":"clan","text":"Once more: Rahul, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466458,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024466464},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466465,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466377,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466377,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466382,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466393,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466402,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466408,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466414,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466439,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466465,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u220-mus9q2w7":{"id":"universe-u220-mus9q2w7","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 4 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024466471},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹58,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466476,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024466480},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466486,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 4","t":1791024466490},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466491,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024466495},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466495,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024466500},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466500,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024466504},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466505,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024466509},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466509,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466471,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024466471,"text":"गोवा 4 लोगों के लिए, pilgrimage, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466480,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466490,"text":"hold karo 4","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466495,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466500,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466504,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466509,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u221-mus9q2xd":{"id":"universe-u221-mus9q2xd","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024466513},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466514,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024466518},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466519,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024466523},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466523,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024466529},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466529,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024466534},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466535,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024466539},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466539,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024466544},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466545,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466513,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466514,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466518,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466523,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466529,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466534,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466539,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466544,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u222-mus9q2yd":{"id":"universe-u222-mus9q2yd","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024466549},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466550,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024466554},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466559,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024466564},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Sameer, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466564,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024466568},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466569,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466549,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466549,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466554,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466564,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466569,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u223-mus9q2z1":{"id":"universe-u223-mus9q2z1","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the captain was rude. i want a refund","t":1791024466573},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024466576,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466573,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466573,"text":"this is not what was promised, the captain was rude. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u224-mus9q2z9":{"id":"universe-u224-mus9q2z9","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024466581},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466581,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466581,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466581,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u225-mus9q2zd":{"id":"universe-u225-mus9q2zd","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"मनाली 12 लोगों के लिए, birthday or anniversary, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024466585},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 12 logon ka total ₹1,50,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466589,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024466594},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. 12 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466601,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 12","t":1791024466607},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466608,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024466613},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466613,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024466617},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466617,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024466623},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466623,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"डिस्काउंट?","t":1791024466627},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹15,000 se upar jaata hai. 12 log ho to organiser ki seat free: ek kam do. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466628,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466585,"said":{"group":12,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466585,"text":"मनाली 12 लोगों के लिए, birthday or anniversary, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466594,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466608,"text":"hold karo 12","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466613,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466617,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466623,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466628,"text":"डिस्काउंट?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u226-mus9q30o":{"id":"universe-u226-mus9q30o","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024466632},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466633,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024466637},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466637,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024466641},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466642,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024466646},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466646,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024466651},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466651,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466632,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466632,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466637,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466641,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466646,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466651,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u227-mus9q31c":{"id":"universe-u227-mus9q31c","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024466656},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466656,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466656,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466656,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u228-mus9q31h":{"id":"universe-u228-mus9q31h","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 2 of us planning goa for a honeymoon, is it available?","t":1791024466661},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Congratulations! Yes, a private double room for the two of you is available: the supplement is about ₹2,200 per person for the whole trip (exact figure with the hotel confirmation), everything else stays the same, and the captain arranges the room decor and a dinner table for two. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 2 people the total is ₹29,000. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 2 seats?","t":1791024466662,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 2 seats","t":1791024466666},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466667,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024466671},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024466672,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024466676},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024466676,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466661,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466661,"text":"hi, 2 of us planning goa for a honeymoon, is it available?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466666,"text":"ok hold 2 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466671,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466676,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u229-mus9q321":{"id":"universe-u229-mus9q321","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024466681},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466681,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466681,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466681,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u230-mus9q326":{"id":"universe-u230-mus9q326","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 10 લોકો માટે, college trip, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024466686},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 10 logon ka total ₹1,45,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466689,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 10","t":1791024466695},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466696,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024466701},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466701,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024466706},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466707,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466686,"said":{"group":10,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466686,"text":"ગોવા 10 લોકો માટે, college trip, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466695,"text":"hold karo 10","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466701,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466706,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u231-mus9q32v":{"id":"universe-u231-mus9q32v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"यह वादा नहीं था, बस 3 घंटे लेट थी। रिफंड चाहिए","t":1791024466711},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024466714,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466711,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466711,"text":"यह वादा नहीं था, बस 3 घंटे लेट थी। रिफंड चाहिए","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u232-mus9q332":{"id":"universe-u232-mus9q332","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024466718},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466719,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466718,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466719,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u233-mus9q337":{"id":"universe-u233-mus9q337","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024466723},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466724,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024466728},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466729,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024466733},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466734,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024466738},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466739,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024466743},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466744,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466723,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024466723,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466728,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466733,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466738,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466743,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u234-mus9q33w":{"id":"universe-u234-mus9q33w","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 2 લોકો માટે, honeymoon, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024466748},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Congratulations! Haan, private double room couple ke liye mil jaata hai: supplement lagbhag ₹2,200 per person poore trip ka (exact figure hotel confirmation ke saath), baaki sab same, aur honeymoon ke liye room decor aur ek dinner table alag se, captain sambhal lega. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹29,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466749,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024466753},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466761,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024466765},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466775,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024466779},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466779,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024466785},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466786,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024466790},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466790,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024466794},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Rahul, Price fixed hai aur sab included hai; alag se hotel + travel + khana jodoge to ₹17,400 se upar jaata hai. Advance abhi, balance 7 din pehle, isse aasaan ho jaata hai.","t":1791024466795,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466748,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466748,"text":"ગોવા 2 લોકો માટે, honeymoon, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466753,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466765,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466779,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466786,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466790,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466795,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u235-mus9q35b":{"id":"universe-u235-mus9q35b","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","t":1791024466799},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024466802,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466799,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466800,"text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u236-mus9q35i":{"id":"universe-u236-mus9q35i","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"गोवा 2 लोगों के लिए, bachelor trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","t":1791024466806},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹29,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466810,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 2","t":1791024466814},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466815,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024466819},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466820,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024466824},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466825,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024466829},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466830,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","t":1791024466834},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024466834,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466806,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466806,"text":"गोवा 2 लोगों के लिए, bachelor trip, क्या उपलब्ध है?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466814,"text":"hold karo 2","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466819,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466824,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466829,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466834,"text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u237-mus9q36f":{"id":"universe-u237-mus9q36f","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024466839},{"role":"clan","text":"Meera, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024466839,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466839,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466839,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u238-mus9q36k":{"id":"universe-u238-mus9q36k","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 4 log, family reunion ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024466844},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Goa plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Beaches; D3 Nightlife; D4 breakfast, last stop, return. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹58,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466848,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 4","t":1791024466852},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466853,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024466857},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466858,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024466863},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466864,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024466868},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466869,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"68 saal ke parents ke liye theek hai?","t":1791024466873},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Zyada traveller 20 se 40 ke hain; relaxed batches mein family aur parents welcome hain. Seniors ke liye: great; ek emergency contact aur dawai ki list le lete hain, aur captain har din unka haal poochta hai. Chaho to founder se 5 minute baat kara doon, phir decide karna. ","t":1791024466874,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466844,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466844,"text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 4 log, family reunion ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466852,"text":"hold karo 4","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466857,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466864,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466869,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466873,"text":"68 saal ke parents ke liye theek hai?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u239-mus9q37i":{"id":"universe-u239-mus9q37i","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024466878},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466879,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024466884},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466884,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024466889},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466890,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024466895},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466895,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024466900},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466900,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024466905},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024466905,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024466910},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Kavya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466910,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024466915},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Kavya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466916,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466878,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024466878,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466884,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466890,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466895,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466900,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466905,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466910,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466915,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u240-mus9q38p":{"id":"universe-u240-mus9q38p","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 2 log, honeymoon ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024466921},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Congratulations! Haan, private double room couple ke liye mil jaata hai: supplement lagbhag ₹2,200 per person poore trip ka (exact figure hotel confirmation ke saath), baaki sab same, aur honeymoon ke liye room decor aur ek dinner table alag se, captain sambhal lega. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹29,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024466921,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 2","t":1791024466926},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466926,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024466931},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466931,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024466937},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024466937,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466921,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024466921,"text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 2 log, honeymoon ke liye, available hai?","intent":"faq:room","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466926,"text":"hold karo 2","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466931,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466937,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u241-mus9q39a":{"id":"universe-u241-mus9q39a","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 24 of us planning manali for a pilgrimage, is it available?","t":1791024466942},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 24 people the total is ₹3,00,000. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 24 seats?","t":1791024466946,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024466951},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹15,000. For 24 people the organiser travels free, so pay for 23. To hold 24 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024466956,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 24 seats","t":1791024466961},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Manali 20 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024466962,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024466966},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024466967,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024466971},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024466972,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024466976},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024466977,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"any discount for 24?","t":1791024466981},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹15,000. For 24 people the organiser travels free, so pay for 23. Your seats are on hold; the team confirms as soon as the advance arrives.","t":1791024466998,"auto":false}],"created":1791024466942,"said":{"group":24,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024466942,"text":"hi, 24 of us planning manali for a pilgrimage, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024466951,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466961,"text":"ok hold 24 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466966,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466972,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466976,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024466981,"text":"any discount for 24?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u242-mus9q3ay":{"id":"universe-u242-mus9q3ay","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024467002},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467003,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024467008},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467009,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024467014},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467014,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024467019},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024467026,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024467030},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467031,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024467035},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467036,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024467042},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467043,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024467047},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Amit, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024467048,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467002,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467003,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467008,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467014,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467019,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467031,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467036,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467042,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467048,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u243-mus9q3cd":{"id":"universe-u243-mus9q3cd","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"મનાલી 4 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024467053},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Manali 20 Dec ko Sunday ko nikalta hai (weekend) aur 24 Dec Thursday ko wapas. Office walon ko 4 din ki chhutti lagegi. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹50,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024467054,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024467058},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467065,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024467070},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467070,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024467075},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467075,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024467080},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467080,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બાળકો માટે ઠીક છે?","t":1791024467085},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Zyada traveller 20 se 40 ke hain; relaxed batches mein family aur parents welcome hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467086,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467053,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467053,"text":"મનાલી 4 લોકો માટે, weekend escape, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467058,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467070,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467075,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467080,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467085,"text":"બાળકો માટે ઠીક છે?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u244-mus9q3de":{"id":"universe-u244-mus9q3de","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024467090},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467091,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024467095},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467101,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024467105},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Dev, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467106,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024467110},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467111,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024467115},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467116,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467090,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467090,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467096,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467105,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467111,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467116,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u245-mus9q3ea":{"id":"universe-u245-mus9q3ea","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024467122},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467122,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024467127},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467127,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024467132},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467133,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024467138},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467138,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024467143},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467144,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024467148},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467149,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024467154},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467154,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467122,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467122,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467127,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467133,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467138,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467143,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467149,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467154,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u246-mus9q3fb":{"id":"universe-u246-mus9q3fb","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467159},{"role":"clan","tex