od ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467283,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","t":1791024467290},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Riya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024467290,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","t":1791024467295},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467296,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","t":1791024467301},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Riya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467302,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467249,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467250,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467255,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467260,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467266,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467278,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467283,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467290,"text":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467296,"text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467301,"text":"ગ્રુપ ને પૂછી ને કહું","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u252-mus9q3je":{"id":"universe-u252-mus9q3je","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024467306},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467307,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024467312},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467317,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024467322},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Pooja, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467323,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024467328},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467328,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024467333},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467333,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024467338},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467339,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","t":1791024467344},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. For seniors: relaxed pace, ground-floor room, the captain stays close; we take an emergency contact and a medicine list, and the captain checks on them every day. If it helps, I can set up a 5 minute call with the founder before you decide. ","t":1791024467344,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467306,"said":{"regroup":false,"group":2},"intents":[{"t":1791024467307,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467312,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467322,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467328,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467333,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467339,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467344,"text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u253-mus9q3kl":{"id":"universe-u253-mus9q3kl","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"મનાલી 2 લોકો માટે, long vacation, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024467349},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 2 logon ka total ₹25,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024467352,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024467357},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467362,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","t":1791024467367},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467368,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024467374},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467374,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467349,"said":{"group":2,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467349,"text":"મનાલી 2 લોકો માટે, long vacation, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467357,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467367,"text":"સુરક્ષિત છે?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467374,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u254-mus9q3lf":{"id":"universe-u254-mus9q3lf","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 3 log, workation ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024467379},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Goa plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Beaches; D3 Nightlife; D4 breakfast, last stop, return. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 3 logon ka total ₹43,500. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024467383,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 3","t":1791024467388},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467389,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024467394},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024467394,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024467399},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024467399,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467379,"said":{"group":3,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467379,"text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 3 log, workation ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467388,"text":"hold karo 3","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467394,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467399,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u255-mus9q3m4":{"id":"universe-u255-mus9q3m4","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467404},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467404,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467404,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467404,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u256-mus9q3m9":{"id":"universe-u256-mus9q3m9","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024467409},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467410,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024467414},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467420,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","t