this is not what was promised, the captain was rude. i want a refund","t":1791024467472},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024467476,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467472,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467473,"text":"this is not what was promised, the captain was rude. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u261-mus9q3o9":{"id":"universe-u261-mus9q3o9","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467481},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467481,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467481,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467481,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u262-mus9q3of":{"id":"universe-u262-mus9q3of","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 19 of us planning goa for a corporate offsite, is it available?","t":1791024467487},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Of course. For 19 people we run a private corporate batch: your own dates, own bus and stay, a GST invoice, and a custom quote within 24 hours. Send the company name, headcount, preferred dates and budget per head; a team member calls you today.","t":1791024467487,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024467493},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 19 people the total is ₹2,75,500. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 19 seats?","t":1791024467494,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok hold 19 seats","t":1791024467499},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Goa 12 Dec is full. I have put you on the waiting list; the first seat that opens is yours. Or: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467500,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024467505},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Yes, of course. Ask me anything else; reply \"hold\" when you want the seats held.","t":1791024467517,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467487,"said":{"group":19,"regroup":false,"price":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024467487,"text":"hi, 19 of us planning goa for a corporate offsite, is it available?","intent":"corporate","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467493,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467499,"text":"ok hold 19 seats","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467505,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u263-mus9q3pe":{"id":"universe-u263-mus9q3pe","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","t":1791024467522},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024467525,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467522,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467522,"text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u264-mus9q3pm":{"id":"universe-u264-mus9q3pm","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467530},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467531,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467530,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467530,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u265-mus9q3pr":{"id":"universe-u265-mus9q3pr","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024467535},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467536,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024467542},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467543,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024467548},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467549,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024467553},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467554,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"बच्चों के लिए ठीक है?","t":1791024467559},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Zyada traveller 20 se 40 ke hain; relaxed batches mein family aur parents welcome hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467559,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024467564},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Neha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467565,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","t":1791024467570},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Neha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467570,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024467575},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467576,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467535,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467536,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467543,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467548,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467554,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467559,"text":"बच्चों के लिए ठीक है?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467564,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467570,"text":"ग्रुप से पूछ के बताता हूँ","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467576,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u266-mus9q3r1":{"id":"universe-u266-mus9q3r1","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 16 of us planning goa for a corporate offsite, is it available?","t":1791024467581},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Of course. For 16 people we run a private corporate batch: your own dates, own bus and stay, a GST invoice, and a custom quote within 24 hours. Send the company name, headcount, preferred dates and budget per head; a team member calls you today.","t":1791024467582,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024467587},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 16 people the total is ₹2,32,000. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 16 seats?","t":1791024467587,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024467593},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹17,400. For 16 people the organiser travels free, so pay for 15. To hold 16 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024467602,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024467607},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024467619,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024467624},{"role":"clan","text":"Sameer, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. To hold 16 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024467625,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467581,"said":{"group":16,"regroup":false,"price":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024467581,"text":"hi, 16 of us planning goa for a corporate offsite, is it available?","intent":"corporate","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467587,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467593,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467608,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467624,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u267-mus9q3sf":{"id":"universe-u267-mus9q3sf","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 3 of us planning manali for a weekend escape, is it available?","t":1791024467631},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Manali departs 20 Dec, a Sunday (weekend), and returns 24 Dec, Thursday. That is 4 days of leave for office-goers. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 3 people the total is ₹37,500. A ₹4,000 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 3 seats?","t":1791024467632,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024467637},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹15,000. Advance now and balance 7 days before departure makes it easier. To hold 3 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024467643,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024467649},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Manali has 17 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024467657,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024467662},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. To hold 3 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024467663,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024467668},{"role":"clan","text":"Rohan, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. To hold 3 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024467668,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467631,"said":{"group":3,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467631,"text":"hi, 3 of us planning manali for a weekend escape, is it available?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467637,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467649,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467663,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467668,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u268-mus9q3tl":{"id":"universe-u268-mus9q3tl","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 15 log, college trip ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024467673},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Goa plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Beaches; D3 Nightlife; D4 breakfast, last stop, return. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 15 logon ka total ₹2,17,500. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024467678,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024467683},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467689,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024467694},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467695,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024467699},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024467700,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467673,"said":{"group":15,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467674,"text":"bhai goa ka plan hai 15 log, college trip ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467683,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467694,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467700,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u269-mus9q3uh":{"id":"universe-u269-mus9q3uh","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hello","t":1791024467705},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467705,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kuch info chahiye","t":1791024467711},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467716,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip ka kya hai?","t":1791024467721},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467727,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024467734},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024467742,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024467747},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467748,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg khana milega?","t":1791024467753},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467753,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"13 logon ke liye discount?","t":1791024467759},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Priya, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024467773,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","t":1791024467778},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467779,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467705,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true,"group":13},"intents":[{"t":1791024467705,"text":"hello","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467711,"text":"kuch info chahiye","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467721,"text":"trip ka kya hai?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467734,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467747,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467753,"text":"veg khana milega?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467759,"text":"13 logon ke liye discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467778,"text":"sab aap handle kar loge? pickup se drop tak","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u270-mus9q3wo":{"id":"universe-u270-mus9q3wo","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024467784},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467785,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024467790},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467790,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024467795},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467796,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","t":1791024467801},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467801,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024467806},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467807,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467784,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467784,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467790,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467795,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467801,"text":"कोई रिव्यू है?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467807,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u271-mus9q3xg":{"id":"universe-u271-mus9q3xg","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"નમસ્તે","t":1791024467812},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467813,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","t":1791024467818},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467819,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ટ્રિપ?","t":1791024467825},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467826,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"પત્ની ને પૂછવું પડશે","t":1791024467831},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467831,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"પત્ની ને પૂછવું પડશે","t":1791024467837},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Amit, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467837,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","t":1791024467843},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467843,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467812,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467812,"text":"નમસ્તે","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467818,"text":"માહિતી જોઈએ છે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467825,"text":"ટ્રિપ?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467831,"text":"પત્ની ને પૂછવું પડશે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467837,"text":"પત્ની ને પૂછવું પડશે","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467843,"text":"બધું તમે સંભાળી લેશો?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u272-mus9q3yh":{"id":"universe-u272-mus9q3yh","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467849},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467849,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467849,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467849,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u273-mus9q3yn":{"id":"universe-u273-mus9q3yn","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467855},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467855,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467855,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467855,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u274-mus9q3ys":{"id":"universe-u274-mus9q3ys","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467860},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467861,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467860,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467860,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u275-mus9q3yy":{"id":"universe-u275-mus9q3yy","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467866},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467866,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467866,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467866,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u276-mus9q3z4":{"id":"universe-u276-mus9q3z4","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"yeh promise nahi tha, room ganda tha. refund chahiye","t":1791024467872},{"role":"clan","text":"Rahul, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024467875,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467872,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467872,"text":"yeh promise nahi tha, room ganda tha. refund chahiye","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u277-mus9q3zc":{"id":"universe-u277-mus9q3zc","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024467880},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467881,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024467886},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467891,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024467896},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Vikram, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467897,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024467903},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467904,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","t":1791024467909},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Included: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Not included: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467909,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024467914},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Vikram, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467930,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","t":1791024467935},{"role":"clan","text":"Once more: Vikram, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467951,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467880,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467880,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467886,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467897,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467904,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467909,"text":"what exactly is included and what is not?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467915,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467935,"text":"ok let me check with the group and get back","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u278-mus9q41g":{"id":"universe-u278-mus9q41g","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","t":1791024467956},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024467960,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467956,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467956,"text":"this is not what was promised, the hotel was nothing like the photos. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u279-mus9q41p":{"id":"universe-u279-mus9q41p","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467965},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467965,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467965,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467965,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u280-mus9q41v":{"id":"universe-u280-mus9q41v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024467971},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024467971,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467971,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467971,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u281-mus9q420":{"id":"universe-u281-mus9q420","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024467976},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467977,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024467982},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467983,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024467988},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024467989,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सुरक्षित है?","t":1791024467994},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024467994,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"क्या शामिल है?","t":1791024468000},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468000,"auto":false}],"created":1791024467976,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024467977,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467983,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024467988,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024467994,"text":"सुरक्षित है?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468000,"text":"क्या शामिल है?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u282-mus9q42v":{"id":"universe-u282-mus9q42v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024468007},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468007,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024468012},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468018,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024468023},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Amit, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468023,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024468028},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468029,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024468034},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468034,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","t":1791024468039},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. For seniors: relaxed pace, ground-floor room, the captain stays close; we take an emergency contact and a medicine list, and the captain checks on them every day. If it helps, I can set up a 5 minute call with the founder before you decide. ","t":1791024468040,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024468045},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468045,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468007,"said":{"regroup":false,"group":2},"intents":[{"t":1791024468007,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468013,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468023,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468029,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468034,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468040,"text":"is it ok for my parents aged 68?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468045,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u283-mus9q443":{"id":"universe-u283-mus9q443","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"yeh promise nahi tha, captain rude tha. refund chahiye","t":1791024468051},{"role":"clan","text":"Vikram, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024468054,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468051,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468051,"text":"yeh promise nahi tha, captain rude tha. refund chahiye","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u284-mus9q44b":{"id":"universe-u284-mus9q44b","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024468059},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468059,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468059,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468059,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u285-mus9q44h":{"id":"universe-u285-mus9q44h","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024468065},{"role":"clan","text":"Dev, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468065,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468065,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468065,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u286-mus9q44m":{"id":"universe-u286-mus9q44m","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024468070},{"role":"clan","text":"Sneha, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468071,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468070,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468070,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u287-mus9q44s":{"id":"universe-u287-mus9q44s","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 1 log, adventure ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024468076},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Manali plan: D1 depart Ahmedabad, check in, evening walk; D2 Solang; D3 Atal Tunnel; D4 Old Manali cafes; D5 breakfast, last stop, return. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024468080,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 1","t":1791024468087},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Manali 20 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468087,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024468093},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024468093,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024468098},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024468098,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024468104},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024468104,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024468109},{"role":"clan","text":"Amit, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024468110,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468076,"said":{"group":1,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468076,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 1 log, adventure ke liye, available hai?","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468087,"text":"hold karo 1","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468093,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468098,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468104,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468110,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u288-mus9q45v":{"id":"universe-u288-mus9q45v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024468115},{"role":"clan","text":"Karan, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468115,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468115,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468115,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u289-mus9q461":{"id":"universe-u289-mus9q461","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024468121},{"role":"clan","text":"Priya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468121,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468121,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468121,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u290-mus9q467":{"id":"universe-u290-mus9q467","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"नमस्ते","t":1791024468127},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Namaste! Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468127,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"जानकारी चाहिए","t":1791024468133},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468133,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"ट्रिप?","t":1791024468139},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468140,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","t":1791024468145},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468146,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","t":1791024468152},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Har meal mein veg aur Jain option, allergy booking par bata do. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468153,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","t":1791024468158},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468159,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","t":1791024468164},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Anjali, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468165,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","t":1791024468170},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Haan, pickup se drop tak sab hum handle karte hain: transport, stay, khana, permits, aur ek trip captain jo group ke saath chalta hai aur wahin sab sort karta hai. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468170,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468127,"said":{"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024468127,"text":"नमस्ते","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468133,"text":"जानकारी चाहिए","intent":"details","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468139,"text":"ट्रिप?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468146,"text":"रद्द करना पड़े तो?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468153,"text":"शाकाहारी खाना?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468158,"text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468164,"text":"पत्नी से पूछना पड़ेगा","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468170,"text":"सब आप संभाल लोगे?","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u291-mus9q47k":{"id":"universe-u291-mus9q47k","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hello","t":1791024468176},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468177,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kuch info chahiye","t":1791024468182},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468188,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip ka kya hai?","t":1791024468193},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Pooja, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468200,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","t":1791024468205},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468206,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024468211},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468211,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024468217},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468217,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468176,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468176,"text":"hello","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468182,"text":"kuch info chahiye","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468193,"text":"trip ka kya hai?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468206,"text":"koi reviews ya proof hai pichle trips ka?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468211,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468217,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u292-mus9q48v":{"id":"universe-u292-mus9q48v","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"ગોવા 24 લોકો માટે, corporate offsite, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","t":1791024468223},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Zaroor. 24 logon ke liye hum private corporate batch chalate hain: aapki apni dates, apni bus aur stay, GST invoice, aur 24 ghante mein custom quote. Company ka naam, headcount, dates aur per-head budget bhej do; team ka member aaj hi call karega.","t":1791024468223,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","t":1791024468230},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Har batch ki photos aur travellers ke reviews hamare Google profile aur Instagram par hain; pichle batch ki photos aur ek purane traveller ka number bhej sakte hain, pay karne se pehle call kar lo. Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 24 logon ka total ₹3,48,000. ₹4,500 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024468231,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"hold karo 24","t":1791024468236},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Goa 12 Dec full ho gaya. Waiting list mein daal diya; seat khulte hi pehle aapko batayenge. Ya fir: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468237,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","t":1791024468242},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024468243,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","t":1791024468248},{"role":"clan","text":"Arjun, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Aapki seat hold hai; advance aate hi team confirm karegi.","t":1791024468249,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468223,"said":{"group":24,"regroup":false,"price":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024468223,"text":"ગોવા 24 લોકો માટે, corporate offsite, ઉપલબ્ધ છે?","intent":"corporate","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468230,"text":"કોઈ રિવ્યુ છે?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468236,"text":"hold karo 24","intent":"book","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468243,"text":"શું સમાવેશ છે?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468249,"text":"રદ કરવું પડે તો?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u293-mus9q49q":{"id":"universe-u293-mus9q49q","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"PLAN","t":1791024468254},{"role":"clan","text":"Kavya, Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468254,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468254,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468254,"text":"PLAN","intent":"details","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u294-mus9q49w":{"id":"universe-u294-mus9q49w","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi, 6 of us planning goa for a pilgrimage, is it available?","t":1791024468260},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Goa: 12 Dec, 4 days, ₹14,500 per person. Stay, travel, meals and a trip captain included, no hidden costs. For 6 people the total is ₹87,000. A ₹4,500 per person advance holds the seats. Shall I hold 6 seats?","t":1791024468264,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"too expensive, any discount?","t":1791024468269},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, The price is fixed and all-inclusive; booking the stay, travel and meals separately comes to over ₹17,400. For 6 people the organiser travels free, so pay for 5. To hold 6 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024468275,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"will think and tell you","t":1791024468281},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Of course, take your time. One thing to know: Goa has 7 seats left; I can hold yours for 24 hours without advance if you want.","t":1791024468289,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024468294},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. To hold 6 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024468294,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024468300},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. To hold 6 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024468300,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it ok for kids aged 6 and 9?","t":1791024468305},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Most travellers are 20 to 40; families and parents are welcome on the relaxed batches. To hold 6 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024468306,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"veg food available?","t":1791024468313},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Vegetarian and Jain options on every meal, tell us allergies at booking. To hold 6 seats, just reply \"hold\".","t":1791024468313,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468260,"said":{"group":6,"price":true,"regroup":false,"veg":true},"intents":[{"t":1791024468260,"text":"hi, 6 of us planning goa for a pilgrimage, is it available?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468269,"text":"too expensive, any discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468281,"text":"will think and tell you","intent":"objection:delay","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468294,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468300,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468306,"text":"is it ok for kids aged 6 and 9?","intent":"faq:age","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468313,"text":"veg food available?","intent":"faq:food","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u295-mus9q4bi":{"id":"universe-u295-mus9q4bi","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","t":1791024468318},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Main samajh gaya, aur yeh hamare liye serious hai. Founder khud aapko 24 ghante ke andar call karenge (9876543210). Jo hua, yahan likh dijiye taaki call se pehle sab pata ho.","t":1791024468321,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468318,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468318,"text":"આ વચન નહોતું, બસ 3 કલાક મોડી હતી. રિફંડ જોઈએ","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u296-mus9q4bq":{"id":"universe-u296-mus9q4bq","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","t":1791024468326},{"role":"clan","text":"Riya, I hear you, and we take this seriously. The founder will personally call you within 24 hours (9876543210). Please write what happened here so nothing is missed before the call.","t":1791024468330,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468326,"said":{"escalated":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468326,"text":"this is not what was promised, the room was dirty. i want a refund","intent":"escalate","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u297-mus9q4bz":{"id":"universe-u297-mus9q4bz","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hi","t":1791024468335},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468336,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"need some info","t":1791024468341},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468347,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip?","t":1791024468352},{"role":"clan","text":"As I mentioned: Anjali, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468353,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"is it safe? any issues before?","t":1791024468358},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, A trip captain travels with every group, we keep an emergency contact for every traveller, women travellers are roomed with women only, and we have run every batch with women travelling solo. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468358,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","t":1791024468364},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Every batch has photos and traveller reviews on our Google profile and Instagram; we can send last batch's photos and a past traveller's number you can call before you pay anything. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468364,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"what if we have to cancel?","t":1791024468370},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Advance is transferable to any other batch within 6 months; cancellation 15+ days before departure refunds everything except the advance; under 15 days no refund because hotels and transport are already paid. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468370,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","t":1791024468376},{"role":"clan","text":"Anjali, Yes, everything from pickup to drop is handled: transport, stay, meals, permits, and a trip captain who travels with the group and sorts anything on the spot. Tell me the dates and how many of you, and I will send the plan and price within the hour.","t":1791024468376,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468335,"said":{"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468335,"text":"hi","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468342,"text":"need some info","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468352,"text":"trip?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468358,"text":"is it safe? any issues before?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468364,"text":"do you have reviews or proof from past trips?","intent":"faq:proof","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468370,"text":"what if we have to cancel?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468376,"text":"can you just handle everything? pickup to drop","intent":"faq:handled","confidence":0.9}]},"universe-u298-mus9q4da":{"id":"universe-u298-mus9q4da","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"hello","t":1791024468382},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Hi! Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468382,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kuch info chahiye","t":1791024468389},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468394,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"trip ka kya hai?","t":1791024468400},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Neha, Kaunsa trip aur kaunsi dates dekh rahe ho, aur kitne log? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468406,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"mehenga hai, discount?","t":1791024468412},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai. Kaunsa trip dekh rahe ho? Main sabse sasta batch dhoondh deta hoon.","t":1791024468420,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","t":1791024468426},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Har group ke saath trip captain hota hai, har traveller ka emergency contact rakhte hain, ladkiyon ki rooming ladkiyon ke saath hi hoti hai, aur har batch mein solo ladkiyan travel kar chuki hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468426,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024468432},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Dates aur kitne log batao, ek ghante mein plan aur price bhejta hoon.","t":1791024468432,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"4 logon ke liye discount?","t":1791024468438},{"role":"clan","text":"Dobara se: Neha, Samajh sakta hoon. Hum advance ₹4,500 aur baaki do kiston mein le lete hain, aur 6+ ke group mein organiser free jaata hai.","t":1791024468454,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024468459},{"role":"clan","text":"Neha, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468476,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024468482},{"role":"clan","text":"Jaise maine bataya: Neha, Which trip and dates are you looking at, and how many of you? Next batches: Goa 12 Dec ₹14,500, Manali 20 Dec ₹12,500.","t":1791024468498,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468382,"said":{"regroup":false,"group":4},"intents":[{"t":1791024468382,"text":"hello","intent":"greet","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468389,"text":"kuch info chahiye","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468400,"text":"trip ka kya hai?","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468412,"text":"mehenga hai, discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468426,"text":"safe hai? pehle koi problem hui?","intent":"faq:safety","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468432,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468439,"text":"4 logon ke liye discount?","intent":"objection:price","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468460,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468482,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]},"universe-u299-mus9q4go":{"id":"universe-u299-mus9q4go","messages":[{"role":"lead","text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 4 log, weekend escape ke liye, available hai?","t":1791024468504},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Manali 20 Dec ko Sunday ko nikalta hai (weekend) aur 24 Dec Thursday ko wapas. Office walon ko 4 din ki chhutti lagegi. Manali: 20 Dec, 5 days, ₹12,500 per person. Stay, travel, khana aur trip captain sab included, koi hidden cost nahi. 4 logon ka total ₹50,000. ₹4,000 per person advance se seat hold ho jaati hai. Hold karun?","t":1791024468505,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"soch ke batata hoon","t":1791024468510},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024468518,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","t":1791024468524},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Included hai: travel from the start city, stay (sharing basis), breakfast and dinner, all sightseeing in the plan, a trip captain who travels with the group. Included nahi: lunches, personal shopping, entry tickets not in the plan, anything marked optional. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024468524,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"cancel karna pade to?","t":1791024468530},{"role":"clan","text":"Pooja, Advance 6 mahine ke andar kisi bhi batch mein transfer ho sakta hai; departure se 15+ din pehle cancel karo to advance chhod ke sab refund; 15 din ke andar refund nahi kyunki hotel aur transport pay ho chuke hote hain. Seat hold karne ke liye bas \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024468530,"auto":false},{"role":"lead","text":"wife se poochna padega","t":1791024468536},{"role":"clan","text":"Short mein: Pooja, Haan, bilkul. Aur kuch poochna ho to poochho; seat hold ke liye \"hold\" likho.","t":1791024468549,"auto":false}],"created":1791024468504,"said":{"group":4,"price":true,"regroup":false},"intents":[{"t":1791024468504,"text":"bhai manali ka plan hai 4 log, weekend escape ke liye, available hai?","intent":"faq:dateq","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468511,"text":"soch ke batata hoon","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5},{"t":1791024468524,"text":"kya kya included hai aur kya nahi?","intent":"faq:included","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468530,"text":"cancel karna pade to?","intent":"faq:cancellation","confidence":0.9},{"t":1791024468536,"text":"wife se poochna padega","intent":"enquiry","confidence":0.5}]}},"log":[{"t":1791024462340,"id":"universe-u0-mus9pzob","source":"universe","handoff":false,"stage":"quoted","intent":"faq:dateq"},{"t":1791024462374,"id":"universe-u0-mus9pzob","source":"universe","handoff":false,"stage":"objection","intent":"objec